                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is an underrated gem. I really enjoyed the time-manipulation mechanics, cinematic storytelling, and intense gunfights. The story kept me curious, and the mix of gameplay with live-action episodes made it feel unique. The combat is satisfying, and the atmosphere is amazing. Although the pacing can feel a little slow at times, it's definitely worth playing for its story and unique concept.",
